{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes","id":1536229,"title":"[Nameless and Acurssed Homebrew Request] More Mage Template Changes?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-05-24T20:12:35-07:00","id":1536229,"title":"[Nameless and Acurssed Homebrew Request] More Mage Template Changes?","content":"Hi guys? how's it going?<br /> So,my favorite thing about Nameless and Accursed is that most of the antagonistic Mages we found there, The Tremere,The Rapt and Scelesti and the Banishers had some kind of change to the mage template. I was hoping you guys had more ideas for the new types of Antagonistic Mages with changes to the basic mage template ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T03:09:27-07:00","id":1536239,"title":"","content":"What role do you think these new antagonists will play in a Chronicle? What themes will they be ruled by?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T03:20:33-07:00","id":1536241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes?p=1536239#post1536239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What role do you think these new antagonists will play in a Chronicle? What themes will they be ruled by?</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't give you a straight answer because I'm not planning a chronicle right now , but for the sake of the idea. Let's say we're are dealing with a template change that is focused on Mage Sight... I tried to come with one and was out of ideas at the end of the day","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T03:35:05-07:00","id":1536242,"title":"","content":"I have (mostly) written a modified awakening which removed the gnosis from the Mage and replaced it with a type of Synergy.<br /> <br /> Basically like the Walkers where they remain in a coma (trapped in their Onerios) but their magic expresses itself as a Greater Tulpa.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When a Walker generates a Greater Tulpa, her soul and psyche merge with the entity. This allows the Walker to escape the prison of her own Oneiros temporarily, fused with her Tulpa and briefly able to influence the world around her. This fusion does not alter the Greater Tulpa\u2019s characteristics or traits, but the mage\u2019s conscious will inhabits and directs it. </div> </div> </div>So inspired by this, I have Tulpaic Awakenings, where the (not a Mage anymore) dissassociates from their Gnosis, rejecting it, and leaving what would be the equivalent of their Greater Tulpa trapped in their Onerios.<br /> <br /> Now Synergy* with that entity seems the more appropriate system to use for managing power level.<br /> <br /> Likewise, I wanted something like Clarity\u2020 to replace Wisdom, since they are trying to work their will be imposing Supernal truths while rejecting the reality of what they are doing. Never really finished it, but as an antagonist it could make an interesting NPC.<br /> <br /> *See Geist the Sin-Eater<br /> \u2020see Changeling the Lost","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T06:40:34-07:00","id":1536249,"title":"","content":"I still need to complete my Invoker as alt Template for mages who are &quot;Awakened&quot; by one of the Bound with some nasty side effects, as well as an Acamoth-based &quot;Awakening&quot;. I'vealso written the Rmoholans as a strange form of mages, while the writeup based on Gutter Magic I think I did include conversion for M:tAw. I also have concept for saint-like template that I need to write. For canon material we still have the Exarchal Awakening and the alternative templates from the Chronicler Guide (artificers, psychics and so forth)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T09:22:00-07:00","id":1536259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes?p=1536249#post1536249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still need to complete my Invoker as alt Template for mages who are &quot;Awakened&quot; by one of the Bound with some nasty side effects, as well as an Acamoth-based &quot;Awakening&quot;. I'vealso written the Rmoholans as a strange form of mages, while the writeup based on Gutter Magic I think I did include conversion for M:tAw. I also have concept for saint-like template that I need to write. For canon material we still have the Exarchal Awakening and the alternative templates from the Chronicler Guide (artificers, psychics and so forth)</div> </div> </div> </div>Saint like template? How so?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 05-25-2024, 12:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T09:28:07-07:00","id":1536260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes?p=1536242#post1536242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have (mostly) written a modified awakening which removed the gnosis from the Mage and replaced it with a type of Synergy.<br /> <br /> Basically like the Walkers where they remain in a coma (trapped in their Onerios) but their magic expresses itself as a Greater Tulpa.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> So inspired by this, I have Tulpaic Awakenings, where the (not a Mage anymore) dissassociates from their Gnosis, rejecting it, and leaving what would be the equivalent of their Greater Tulpa trapped in their Onerios.<br /> <br /> Now Synergy* with that entity seems the more appropriate system to use for managing power level.<br /> <br /> Likewise, I wanted something like Clarity\u2020 to replace Wisdom, since they are trying to work their will be imposing Supernal truths while rejecting the reality of what they are doing. Never really finished it, but as an antagonist it could make an interesting NPC.<br /> <br /> *See Geist the Sin-Eater<br /> \u2020see Changeling the Lost</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice, so they'd have systems similar to geists and changelings without necessarily having connections to those splats?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T09:29:03-07:00","id":1536261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes?p=1536249#post1536249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still need to complete my Invoker as alt Template for mages who are &quot;Awakened&quot; by one of the Bound with some nasty side effects, as well as an Acamoth-based &quot;Awakening&quot;. I'vealso written the Rmoholans as a strange form of mages, while the writeup based on Gutter Magic I think I did include conversion for M:tAw. I also have concept for saint-like template that I need to write. For canon material we still have the Exarchal Awakening and the alternative templates from the Chronicler Guide (artificers, psychics and so forth)</div> </div> </div> </div>How would you do a psychic as a template change from a base Mage?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T10:53:53-07:00","id":1536264,"title":"","content":"Probably would follow the rules from the Chronicler's Guide","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T14:34:10-07:00","id":1536273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes?p=1536260#post1536260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nice, so they'd have systems similar to geists and changelings without necessarily having connections to those splats?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it would mean lifting the Synergy system for power from Geist, but retaining the powers in Mage.<br /> <br /> Though potentially at Synergy 10 you become one with your Supernal being and ascend.. (who knows)<br /> <br /> And Clarity, because you are essentially denying magic so active Mage sight makes you think you are crazy, and clarity seems like a pretty good mechanism for handling having your view on reality messed up, even to the point where having lits of Synergy means you and your Supernal being are thinking and seeing things the same way, which is really bad for your clarity ...<br /> <br /> But in essence it is a modified Mage splatt, which just happens to take mechanics which work elsewhere","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T14:49:09-07:00","id":1536274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes?p=1536273#post1536273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, it would mean lifting the Synergy system for power from Geist, but retaining the powers in Mage.<br /> <br /> Though potentially at Synergy 10 you become one with your Supernal being and ascend.. (who knows)<br /> <br /> And Clarity, because you are essentially denying magic so active Mage sight makes you think you are crazy, and clarity seems like a pretty good mechanism for handling having your view on reality messed up, even to the point where having lits of Synergy means you and your Supernal being are thinking and seeing things the same way, which is really bad for your clarity ...<br /> <br /> But in essence it is a modified Mage splatt, which just happens to take mechanics which work elsewhere</div> </div> </div> </div>Fascinating","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-26T07:00:31-07:00","id":1536297,"title":"","content":"I would love to see a template based on temporal anomalies, such as the mage being affected by some kind of Aponoia, having to gain anchors to the current timeline to remain stable, maybe to avoid becoming something similar to the Shifters from <i>Quantum Break</i>.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-29T13:08:19-07:00","id":1536524,"title":"","content":"When I was starting to get back into the game more I had an idea about mages who essentially volunteer themselves as living prisons for the Bound, functioning as a bit of a loophole in what they're bound to; still imprisoned, but in something with mobility and agency that can carry out their requests of where to be and what to do. I had some kind of idea that something about the process would make their need to eat magic more acute, to the point that they'd not only suck up the likes of Hallows or try to draw mana out of mages and other receptacles, but would basically decay and ultimately destroy any Mystery they became engaged with at the same level as if their host had just been investigating and understanding it as normal.<br /> <br /> I'll admit, I feel a bit less confident in the idea now than I did at the time. I have a lot of regard for the inventiveness behind things like the Rapt and version of the Tremere that we've ultimately gotten (and even Harrowed Banishers seem to accomplish quite a lot with a straightforward but very significant template addition), and it makes it hard for me to feel like some other ideas I might come up with for a kind of mutated mage template don't amount to just treading already established ground.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-30T01:06:47-07:00","id":1536555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes#post1536229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi guys? how's it going?<br /> So,my favorite thing about Nameless and Accursed is that most of the antagonistic Mages we found there, The Tremere,The Rapt and Scelesti and the Banishers had some kind of change to the mage template. I was hoping you guys had more ideas for the new types of Antagonistic Mages with changes to the basic mage template ?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have a pretty simple idea - not for antagonistic Mages, but for Gnosis-affliction which could make for a pretty scary threat. Just link Arcana of mage with Scars in the same way Deviants link them with Variations, and you have a lot of possibilities for magic costing Awakened a lot more than just need for spend Mana and absorb Paradox.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-30T17:19:16-07:00","id":1536594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dark Archon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes?p=1536555#post1536555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have a pretty simple idea - not for antagonistic Mages, but for Gnosis-affliction which could make for a pretty scary threat. Just link Arcana of mage with Scars in the same way Deviants link them with Variations, and you have a lot of possibilities for magic costing Awakened a lot more than just need for spend Mana and absorb Paradox.</div> </div> </div> </div>Damn! that's a great idea!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-30T17:21:33-07:00","id":1536595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536229-nameless-and-acurssed-homebrew-request-more-mage-template-changes?p=1536524#post1536524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I was starting to get back into the game more I had an idea about mages who essentially volunteer themselves as living prisons for the Bound, functioning as a bit of a loophole in what they're bound to; still imprisoned, but in something with mobility and agency that can carry out their requests of where to be and what to do. I had some kind of idea that something about the process would make their need to eat magic more acute, to the point that they'd not only suck up the likes of Hallows or try to draw mana out of mages and other receptacles, but would basically decay and ultimately destroy any Mystery they became engaged with at the same level as if their host had just been investigating and understanding it as normal.<br /> <br /> I'll admit, I feel a bit less confident in the idea now than I did at the time. I have a lot of regard for the inventiveness behind things like the Rapt and version of the Tremere that we've ultimately gotten (and even Harrowed Banishers seem to accomplish quite a lot with a straightforward but very significant template addition), and it makes it hard for me to feel like some other ideas I might come up with for a kind of mutated mage template don't amount to just treading already established ground.</div> </div> </div> </div>could work very welll","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}